<section class="philosophy-statement-section hairline-b" id="philosophy-statement">
  <div class="container-minimal">
    <div class="split-layout">
      <!-- Left Column: Monumental Heading -->
      <div class="split-heading-col">
        <span class="mono-meta section-label">01 // DOCTRINE</span>
        <h2 class="drasa-section-title">
          A unique<br />Philosophy<span class="title-dot">.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Statement & Callout -->
      <div class="split-content-col">
        <p class="statement-body">
          Elena Vance is an atelier and a workshop. We help cultural institutions, forward-thinking brands, and founders experiment their way to clearer identities and enduring publications, using the subtractive rigor and typographic craft the best teams trust.
        </p>

        <p class="statement-secondary">
          The world is faster, louder, and more saturated with disposable visual noise than anything that came before. In that world, restraint is no longer optional — it is the practice that must be trained deliberately, the way any other capacity is trained.
        </p>

        <div class="action-wrap">
          <a href="/philosophy" class="btn-pill">
            <span>Read the full manifesto</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .philosophy-statement-section {
    padding: var(--space-section) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .split-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-10);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .split-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1.3fr;
      gap: var(--space-16);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .split-heading-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .section-label {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
  }

  .split-content-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .statement-body {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.2vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .statement-secondary {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .action-wrap {
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
